{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん、美味しい\r\n外側はビターチョコレートなんだな。ちょっと苦い","trans":"嗯，好吃\n外层是苦巧克力啊。有点苦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400500010","name":"美琴","text":"うん、苦いね","trans":"嗯，是苦的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あ、でも中心の方は甘いみたいだ","trans":"啊，不过中间好像是甜的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400500020","name":"美琴","text":"……本当だね、甘い","trans":"……真的呢，是甜的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"一緒に食べるとちょうどいいな","trans":"一起吃就刚刚好","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400500030","name":"美琴","text":"苦くて……甘い","trans":"又苦……又甜","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400500040","name":"美琴","text":"……あ、プロデューサー\r\n口の横にチョコがついているみたい","trans":"……啊，制作人\n嘴边好像沾到巧克力了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え、どっちだ？　こっちか？","trans":"诶，哪边？这边吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400500050","name":"美琴","text":"そっちじゃなくて\r\nあっ……広がっちゃった","trans":"不是那边\n啊……蹭开了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902400500060","name":"美琴","text":"髭みたい","trans":"像胡子一样","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}